{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"薄扶林婆婆斑馬線過馬路　遭客貨車撞傷\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/TA-CF-261116-10.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】薄扶林一名女子在斑馬線過馬路時遭客貨車撞倒，昏迷送院。</p><p>涉事客貨車停在斑馬線上，警員在現場調查。早上8時許，該客貨車在置富南區廣場駛出置富道時，撞倒一名正在斑馬線過路的婆婆，傷者由救護車送往瑪麗醫院救治，客貨車司機帶上警車協助調查。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T02:51:02.524403+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T02:11:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T15:53:29.504077+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T02:44:36.405895+00:00","content_hash":"90aadd2eeacb2d1e7dcdabc96d0e6672f3f84cfcffddd616d3238ee8eaadb620","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T02:51:02.524403+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}